  ('b635c358-59eb-4fb0-96a8-7eaace9bb47e', 'f2a3b4c5-6d7e-4f77-8a77-8b9c0d1e2f07', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Generation of 1898, Modernismo, and Avant-Garde Spain', 'Around 1898 and the early twentieth century, writers confront national crisis and aesthetic renewal. This unit connects intellectual debate, regional identity, modernismo, and avant-garde experimentation.', 7),
